ems: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>High‑density foam inserts</strong> line all contact edges to absorb impacts.</span></li><li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Durable, slip‑resistant covers</strong> safeguard against abrasion and environmental exposure.</span></li></ul></div>
