<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Delhi to Pune | Express Multi-Car Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes packers and movers delhi to pune specialized for car transport compared to regular movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our service uses dedicated multi‑car carriers equipped with hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and 4‑wheel lock systems that secure each vehicle individually. Unlike generic movers, we provide a zero‑scratch guarantee, live GPS tracking, and IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, ensuring your car arrives in Pune exactly as it left Delhi.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transport from Delhi to Pune typically take and can I track it?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 1,533 km journey via NH 19 usually takes 28‑32 hours depending on traffic and weather. Every shipment is fitted with a satellite‑GPS device, allowing you to monitor real‑time location through our client portal. Delays are communicated instantly, and our team coordinates with you for any route adjustments.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for the RTO and statutory compliance when moving a vehicle interstate?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate, valid insurance policy, a signed e‑Way bill, a copy of your driving licence, and a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the current RTO. Our relocation experts prepare and verify each document, ensuring smooth clearance at both Delhi and Pune RTO offices.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the quoted price for Delhi‑to‑Pune car transport all‑inclusive?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our transparent pricing includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and loading/unloading labor. Optional services such as premium packing, door‑to‑door delivery, or expedited transit are listed separately. There are no hidden fees, and the quote reflects the current market rates for affordable packers and movers delhi.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport more than one vehicle in a single trip from Delhi to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our 18‑ft, 22‑ft, and 32‑ft multi‑car carriers can accommodate up to four cars per trip, each secured with individual wheel locks and edge padding. The cost per additional vehicle is calculated on a per‑car basis, and the same zero‑scratch guarantee applies to every vehicle.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken during loading and unloading on the hydraulic ramp?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained technicians perform a joint inspection with the customer, secure the car on the hydraulic ramp, engage the 4‑wheel lock, and place edge‑padding around vulnerable parts. The ramp is lowered slowly, and the vehicle is strapped with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, ensuring no movement or scratches during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does your service compare with other reviews like Goyal Cargo packers and movers Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While Goyal Cargo has mixed feedback, our 4.9/5 Google rating reflects over 22,000 successful moves. We are IBA‑approved, ISO 9001:2015 certified, and offer a 100 % declared‑value insurance policy. Customers consistently praise our punctuality, transparent pricing, and the zero‑scratch guarantee for car transport.</p>
      </div>
